<title>USA: Alliance Communications sees growth.</title>
<headline>Alliance Communications sees growth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Communications Corp said Wednesday that it is &quot;well positioned for continued growth over the next year.&quot;</p>
<p>The company reported earnings per share of C$0.53 for the fourth quarter, up from C$0.48 in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Alliance said it expects the growth to offset the decline in Alliance Equicap's contribution going forward, &quot;and we are confident that this growth will continue well into the future.&quot;</p>
</text>
